### Structure of Functions


::: {.cell layout-align="center"}

```{.r .cell-code}
coef_of_var <- function(x){
  sd(x) / mean(x)
}
```
:::


* Name: `coef_of_var`

* Inputs/Arguments: `x`

* Body: `sd(x)/mean(x)`



