### Non-Standard Evaluation

Need to embrace `x`!


::: {.cell layout-align="center" output-location='column'}

```{.r .cell-code}
histo <- function(data, x, ...){
  #Determine if x is numeric
  x_class <- data %>%
    pull({{ x }}) %>%
    is.numeric()
  stopifnot(x_class)

  ggplot(data = data, mapping = aes(x = {{ x }})) +
    geom_histogram()
}
histo(pdxTrees_parks, DBH)
```

